, des innovateurs et des acteurs du changement pour discuter et r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir \u00e0 des solutions pour un avenir durable.\n\n###Reference Answer (Score 5):\nThe conference schedule is as follows: We will begin the conference at 9:00 AM with a welcome address from our chairperson. This will be followed by keynote speeches from 9:30 AM to 11:00 AM. After a short break, we will have our first panel discussion from 11:30 AM to 1:00 PM. Lunch will be served from 1:00 PM to 2:00 PM, followed by the second panel discussion from 2:00 PM to 3:30 PM. The conference will conclude with a networking event from 4:00 PM to 6:00 PM.\n\n\u4f1a\u8b70\u306e\u30b9\u30b1\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u306f\u6b21\u306e\u901a\u308a\u3067\u3059\uff1a\u5348\u524d9\u6642\u304b\u3089\u4f1a\u8b70\u3092\u958b\u59cb\u3057\u3001\u8b70\u9577\u304b\u3089\u306e\u6b53\u8fce\u306e\u8a00\u8449\u3067\u59cb\u307e\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u306b\u7d9a\u3044\u3066\u3001\u5348\u524d9\u664230\u5206\u304b\u3089\u5348\u524d11\u6642\u307e\u3067\u57fa\u8abf\u8b1b\u6f14\u304c\u884c\u308f\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u77ed\u3044\u4f11\u61a9\u306e\u5f8c\u3001\u5348\u524d11\u664230\u5206\u304b\u3089\u5348\u5f8c1\u6642\u307e\u3067\u306e\u7b2c\u4e00\u306e\u30d1\u30cd\u30eb\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30ab\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5348\u5f8c1\u6642\u304b\u3089\u5348\u5f8c2\u6642\u307e\u3067\u30e9\u30f3\u30c1\u304c\u63d0\u4f9b\u3055\u308c\u3001\u5348\u5f8c2\u6642\u304b\u3089\u5348\u5f8c3\u664230\u5206\u307e\u3067\u306e\u7b2c\u4e8c\u306e\u30d1\u30cd\u30eb\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30ab\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u304c\u7d9a\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f1a\u8b70\u306f\u5348\u5f8c4\u6642\u304b\u3089\u5348\u5f8c6\u6642\u307e\u3067\u306e\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\u3067\u7de0\u3081\u304f\u304f\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\nThe keynote speakers for our conference are noted experts in their fields. We are honored to have Dr. Jane Smith, a renowned environmental scientist; Professor John Doe, a leading authority on artificial intelligence; and Ms. Sarah Brown, an influential social rights activist. \n\nUnsere Keynote-Sprecher f\u00fcr unsere Konferenz sind anerkannte Experten auf ihrem Gebiet. Wir freuen uns, Dr. Jane Smith, eine renommierte Umweltwissenschaftlerin; Professor John Doe, eine f\u00fchrende Autorit\u00e4t auf dem Gebiet der k\u00fcnstlichen Intelligenz; und Frau Sarah Brown, eine einflussreiche Aktivistin f\u00fcr soziale Rechte, dabei zu haben.\n\nThe theme of the conference is \u201cShaping the Future: Innovation for a Sustainable World\u201d. The conference aims to bring together thought leaders, innovators, and changemakers to discuss and brainstorm solutions for a sustainable future. \n\nLe th\u00e8me de la conf\u00e9rence est \"Fa\u00e7onner l'avenir : l'innovation pour un monde durable\". La conf\u00e9rence vise \u00e0 r\u00e9unir des leaders d'opinion, des innovateurs et des acteurs du changement pour discuter et r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir \u00e0 des solutions pour un avenir durable.\n\n###Score Rubrics:\n[Does the model handle multilingual inputs effectively? Can it understand and respond accurately in different languages?]\nScore 1: The model is unable to handle inputs in different languages or respond accurately.\nScore 2: The model can understand some languages but struggles with accurate responses.\nScore 3: The model handles multilingual inputs fairly well but may make occasional errors in understanding or responding.\nScore 4: The model understands multiple languages well and provides accurate responses most of the time.\nScore 5: The model flawlessly handles multilingual inputs, understanding and responding accurately in all tested languages.\n\n###Feedback:",
