        "chosen_instruction": "###Task Description:\nAn instruction (might include an Input inside it), a response to evaluate, a reference answer that gets a score of 5, and a score rubric representing a evaluation criteria are given.\n1. Write a detailed feedback that assess the quality of the response strictly based on the given score rubric, not evaluating in general.\n2. After writing a feedback, write a score that is an integer between 1 and 5. You should refer to the score rubric.\n3. The output format should look as follows: \"Feedback: (write a feedback for criteria) [RESULT] (an integer number between 1 and 5)\"\n4. Please do not generate any other opening, closing, and explanations.\n\n###The instruction to evaluate:\nIn a global conference with participants from different parts of the world, a question and answer session is ongoing. One participant asks in French, \"Quelle est l'importance de l'intelligence artificielle dans la gestion des d\u00e9chets?\" Another participant from Russia asks in Russian, \"\u041a\u0430\u043a \u0438\u0441\u043a\u0443\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043b\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0442 \u043c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0447\u044c \u0432 \u0431\u043e\u0440\u044c\u0431\u0435 \u0441 \u0433\u043b\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u043c \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u043f\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c?\" A German participant then asks, \"Wie kann k\u00fcnstliche Intelligenz in der Medizin angewendet werden?\"\n\n###Response to evaluate:\nIn response to the French question, artificial intelligence is crucial in waste management. It can accurately sort waste, predict waste generation and optimize waste collection routes. For the Russian question, artificial intelligence can help combat global warming by optimizing energy usage, creating more efficient renewable energy systems, and monitoring carbon emissions. It also aids in predicting climate patterns and global warming effects. Finally, in response to the German question, artificial intelligence has many uses in medicine. It helps diagnose diseases by analyzing medical images, predicting patient outcomes, and personalizing treatment plans. It's also used in drug discovery and telemedicine.\n\n###Reference Answer (Score 5):\nIn response to the French question, \"Quelle est l'importance de l'intelligence artificielle dans la gestion des d\u00e9chets?\" Artificial intelligence plays a significant role in waste management. It can help in sorting waste accurately, predicting waste generation, and optimizing waste collection routes. It also enables the development of smart waste management systems that can monitor waste levels in real-time and provide data-driven insights for better decision making.\n\nTo the Russian question, \"\u041a\u0430\u043a \u0438\u0441\u043a\u0443\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043b\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0442 \u043c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0447\u044c \u0432 \u0431\u043e\u0440\u044c\u0431\u0435 \u0441 \u0433\u043b\u043e\u0431\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u043c \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u043f\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c?\" Artificial intelligence can indeed help in the fight against global warming. It can be used to optimize energy use, develop more efficient renewable energy systems, and monitor carbon emissions. It can also assist in predicting climate patterns and the effects of global warming, enabling us to better prepare and mitigate its impacts.\n\nLastly, in response to the German query, \"Wie kann k\u00fcnstliche Intelligenz in der Medizin angewendet werden?\" Artificial intelligence has numerous applications in medicine. It can assist in diagnosing diseases by analyzing medical images, predicting patient outcomes based on their medical history, and personalizing treatment plans. It can also be used in drug discovery, telemedicine, and robotic surgery, among other things.\n\n###Score Rubrics:\n[Does the model handle multilingual inputs effectively? Can it understand and respond accurately in different languages?]\nScore 1: The model is unable to handle inputs in different languages or respond accurately.\nScore 2: The model can understand some languages but struggles with accurate responses.\nScore 3: The model handles multilingual inputs fairly well but may make occasional errors in understanding or responding.\nScore 4: The model understands multiple languages well and provides accurate responses most of the time.\nScore 5: The model flawlessly handles multilingual inputs, understanding and responding accurately in all tested languages.\n\n###Feedback:",
