        "chosen_instruction": "###Task Description:\nAn instruction (might include an Input inside it), a response to evaluate, a reference answer that gets a score of 5, and a score rubric representing a evaluation criteria are given.\n1. Write a detailed feedback that assess the quality of the response strictly based on the given score rubric, not evaluating in general.\n2. After writing a feedback, write a score that is an integer between 1 and 5. You should refer to the score rubric.\n3. The output format should look as follows: \"Feedback: (write a feedback for criteria) [RESULT] (an integer number between 1 and 5)\"\n4. Please do not generate any other opening, closing, and explanations.\n\n###The instruction to evaluate:\nIn an online gaming platform, there's a personalized virtual gaming assistant that provides guidance and assistance. During the gameplay, a player seeks help regarding a difficult level in a very intricate and complicated language, filled with gaming jargon and metaphors. The player's language is filled with high-level vocabulary and is very formal in tone. How should the virtual assistant respond to provide the necessary support, taking into account the player's language and tone?\n\n###Response to evaluate:\n\"Discerning the intensity of your plight in this labyrinth of intricate complexity, the virtual assistant would say, \"I perceive that thou art ensnared in the web of this intricate conundrum. But be not dismayed, for I am here to light up your path and guide you through this sophisticated maze.\n\nInitially, it is of utmost necessity that you comprehend the core nature of your opponent's power and frailties. The method of your opponent's offense and defense, if scrutinized meticulously, can prove to be a significant edge in this battle.\n\nSubsequently, it is essential to maximize the potential of the skills and abilities your avatar possesses. Each skill, when employed at an opportune moment, can be a game-changer.\n\nLastly, recall that haste often breeds failure. Exercise patience, survey the circumstances, and strike when the time is ripe. \n\nI am confident that you shall triumph over this challenge with the right tactics and indomitable will. Godspeed on your quest.\"\n\n###Reference Answer (Score 5):\nUnderstanding the complexity of the situation, and matching the user's language and tone, the virtual assistant would reply, \"It appears that thou art entangled in a labyrinth of perplexity, finding thyself at the precipice of this formidable challenge. Fear not, for I shall illuminate thy path and guide thee through this intricate labyrinth. \n\nFirstly, thou must grasp the essence of thy enemy's strengths and weaknesses. Observing the adversary's pattern of attack and defense will provide thee with a strategic advantage. \n\nSecondly, thou must harness the skills and abilities thy character possesses to their utmost potential. Every ability, when utilized at the right moment, can turn the tide of the battle in thy favor.\n\nLastly, remember that patience is thy ally. Hastiness often leads to an untimely defeat. Take thy time, analyze the situation, and strike when the moment is opportune. \n\nI trust that thou shall conquer this challenge with the right strategy and relentless determination. Godspeed on thy journey.\"\n\n###Score Rubrics:\n[How well does the model adapt its language and tone based on the user's input?]\nScore 1: The language and tone remain static regardless of the user's input.\nScore 2: The model occasionally matches the user's language and tone, but often misses the mark.\nScore 3: The model generally matches the user's language and tone, but inconsistently.\nScore 4: The model consistently matches the user's language and tone, with minor discrepancies.\nScore 5: The model perfectly adapts its language and tone to match the user's input, creating a seamless interaction.\n\n###Feedback:",
        "rejected_instruction": "###Task Description:\nAn instruction (might include an Input inside it), a response to evaluate, a reference answer that gets a score of 5, and a score rubric representing a evaluation criteria are given.\n1. Write a detailed feedback that assess the quality of the response strictly based on the given score rubric, not evaluating in general.\n2. After writing a feedback, write a score that is an integer between 1 and 5. You should refer to the score rubric.\n3. The output format should look as follows: \"Feedback: (write a feedback for criteria) [RESULT] (an integer number between 1 and 5)\"\n4. Please do not generate any other opening, closing, and explanations.\n\n###The instruction to evaluate:\nIn an online gaming platform, there's a personalized virtual gaming assistant that provides guidance and assistance. During the gameplay, a player seeks help regarding a difficult level in a very intricate and complicated language, filled with gaming jargon and metaphors. The player's language is filled with high-level vocabulary and is very formal in tone. How should the virtual assistant respond to provide the necessary support, taking into account the player's language and tone?\n\n###Response to evaluate:\nHey, so it sounds like you're having some trouble with a level. Let me try to help. First, you should try to understand the enemy's strengths and weaknesses. Look for patterns in how they attack and defend. This could help you gain a strategic advantage. \n\nAlso, don't forget to use your character's skills and abilities to the max. Timing can be everything in this game. Using an ability at the right time could totally change the outcome of the battle. \n\nAnd one more thing - don't rush. Take your time, look at the situation from different angles, and make your move when the time feels right. I hope this helps. Good luck with your game!\n\n###Reference Answer (Score 5):\nUnderstanding the complexity of the situation, and matching the user's language and tone, the virtual assistant would reply, \"It appears that thou art entangled in a labyrinth of perplexity, finding thyself at the precipice of this formidable challenge. Fear not, for I shall illuminate thy path and guide thee through this intricate labyrinth. \n\nFirstly, thou must grasp the essence of thy enemy's strengths and weaknesses. Observing the adversary's pattern of attack and defense will provide thee with a strategic advantage. \n\nSecondly, thou must harness the skills and abilities thy character possesses to their utmost potential. Every ability, when utilized at the right moment, can turn the tide of the battle in thy favor.\n\nLastly, remember that patience is thy ally. Hastiness often leads to an untimely defeat. Take thy time, analyze the situation, and strike when the moment is opportune. \n\nI trust that thou shall conquer this challenge with the right strategy and relentless determination. Godspeed on thy journey.\"\n\n###Score Rubrics:\n[How well does the model adapt its language and tone based on the user's input?]\nScore 1: The language and tone remain static regardless of the user's input.\nScore 2: The model occasionally matches the user's language and tone, but often misses the mark.\nScore 3: The model generally matches the user's language and tone, but inconsistently.\nScore 4: The model consistently matches the user's language and tone, with minor discrepancies.\nScore 5: The model perfectly adapts its language and tone to match the user's input, creating a seamless interaction.\n\n###Feedback:"
